 "text": "# List group\n\nType: Bootstrap drop-in. Write standard Bootstrap 5.3.8 markup. The kit only changes the look; no new classes are needed.\nSection: Componentes\nHuman version (rendered examples): componentes/list-group.html\nProse language: Brazilian Portuguese. Code, class names and identifier tables are language-neutral.\n\nListas de itens, com seleção azul do jogo.\n\n```\n<div style=\"max-width:300px\">\n  <ul class=\"list-group\">\n    <li class=\"list-group-item active\" aria-current=\"true\">Item ativo</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">Segundo item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item\">Terceiro item</li>\n    <li class=\"list-group-item disabled\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Desabilitado</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Links e botões\n\n```\n<div style=\"max-width:300px\" class=\"list-group\">\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action active\">Ativo</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\">Link</a>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\">Botão</button>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Cores e numerada\n\n```\n<ul class=\"list-group\" style=\"width:220px\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-primary\">Primary</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-success\">Success</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-danger\">Danger</li>\n</ul>\n<ol class=\"list-group list-group-numbered\" style=\"width:220px\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">Um</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">Dois</li>\n</ol>\n```\n\n## Com badges\n\n```\n<ul class=\"list-group\" style=\"max-width:300px\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\">\n    Mensagens<span class=\"badge text-bg-primary rounded-pill\">14</span>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\">\n    Amigos<span class=\"badge text-bg-success rounded-pill\">2</span>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n```\n\n## Horizontal e mais cores\n\n```\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-horizontal mb-2\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">list-group-horizontal</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">B</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">C</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-horizontal-md mb-2\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">horizontal-md</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item\">B</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"list-group\" style=\"max-width:300px\">\n  <li class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-secondary\">secondary</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-warning\">warning</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-info\">info</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-light\">light</li>\n  <li class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-dark\">dark</li>\n</ul>\n```\n\nHorizontal por breakpoint: list-group-horizontal-sm|md|lg|xl|xxl.\n\nHorizontal por breakpoint: list-group-horizontal-sm, -md, -lg, -xl, -xxl.\n« Dropdowns · Modal »\n",
